Third-party dependencies
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

DRIFTFALL links against the following third-party libraries. Each is fetched
at configure time by CMake and retains its own license. All are permissive
and compatible with redistribution under the Apache License 2.0.

  SDL3            https://github.com/libsdl-org/SDL          zlib
  bgfx / bx / bimg https://github.com/bkaradzic/bgfx         BSD-2-Clause
  EnTT            https://github.com/skypjack/entt           MIT
  GLM             https://github.com/g-truc/glm              MIT
  doctest         https://github.com/doctest/doctest         MIT

Planned (not yet vendored):

  Jolt Physics    https://github.com/jrouwe/JoltPhysics      MIT
  miniaudio       https://github.com/mackron/miniaudio       MIT-0 / public domain
  Dear ImGui      https://github.com/ocornut/imgui           MIT

